</style></div></div><div class="home-stages-wrapper"><div id="Humanized" class="home-stages-step"><div id="w-node-d10b222d-46c3-1405-2633-d0a302544aa6-307598e7" class="home-stages-mobile_step"><div data-wf--vector-4x4--variant="black" class="vector _4x4 w-variant-7b4c0327-32c3-33f3-e066-3edeea8e8995"></div><div class="button-label">Humanized</div></div><div id="w-node-ed2a7233-41b1-2d64-6a64-2492a85b62f5-307598e7" class="home-stages-step_h2"><h2>Access any website on the web</h2></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="d29c10e2-d242-bab8-f90a-7f2986ab556a" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d232baea426c21261d3_anchor_10.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Anchor Chromium</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Fast, stealthy and secure chromium fork that is recognized as a human</p></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="c6b193ff-cfe1-1d07-20e8-19cb7b186443" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d23c7725ede3249f106_anchor_11.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Web-Bot-Auth Verified</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Verified by industry leader bot protection mechanism, to provide safe access to good bots</p></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-partner"><div class="text-style-caption text-color-neutral_600">Official partner</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68e76a236cc4873330759a2b_cloudflare.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cloudflare-logo"/></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="1311a1d2-b4f6-9790-b74b-0e3082cf73f0" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d2387106f666eadf15c_anchor_18.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Scale without limits</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted"><strong>Infinitely scalable</strong> browsers infrastructure - Run millions of browsers in parallel</p></div></div></div></div><div id="Authenticated" class="home-stages-step"><div id="w-node-_4f701c46-8e72-700b-7870-2a304d387606-307598e7" class="home-stages-mobile_step blue"><div data-wf--vector-4x4--variant="black" class="vector _4x4 w-variant-7b4c0327-32c3-33f3-e066-3edeea8e8995"></div><div class="button-label">Authenticated</div></div><div id="w-node-_9f5f0569-3eb0-de5c-b19b-e02961282c46-307598e7" class="home-stages-step_h2"><h2>Handle authentication for any user </h2></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="371cf9b8-83fb-2a01-2e5e-b46375f383c4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d2332f5f3094659c131_anchor_13.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">OmniConnect™</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">End to end authentication infrastructure for cloud computer-use agents</p><div class="home-stages-step_item-partner"><div class="text-style-caption text-color-neutral_600">Official partner</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-2600.png 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg-p-3200.png 3200w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d1052e8bfb5634c7f69937_1Password_wordmark_blue_2023.svg.png 3840w" alt="" class="cloudflare-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="066a5232-bd1a-8a37-1cb2-58e3428862a2" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d23b6d2fc3ff185bf5e_anchor_14.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Anchor VPN</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">A built-in enterprise VPN, providing a secure network backbone that doesn&#x27;t rely on 3rd party proxies</p></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="223f8f89-b770-5933-4d1a-48bebc9ae7da" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d23c9d3ff0b1d6ea39c_anchor_15.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Authentication Lifecycle</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Anchor handles onboarding, management, and utilization of any human-intended auth method</p></div></div></div><div id="Reliable" class="home-stages-step"><div id="w-node-bc45e288-d3f1-f550-b085-edbf878b0206-307598e7" class="home-stages-mobile_step pink"><div data-wf--vector-4x4--variant="black" class="vector _4x4 w-variant-7b4c0327-32c3-33f3-e066-3edeea8e8995"></div><div class="button-label">Reliable</div></div><div id="w-node-a42dc272-47cf-f42e-2c4c-2004de9f9f3d-307598e7" class="home-stages-step_h2"><h2>Secure &amp; Reliable by design</h2></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="f55d12de-04d3-67f4-603c-53d3c25a7afe" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d23c0336d74aafad963_anchor_16.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Secure by design</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Anchor is built by security experts, and makes computer-use secure by design</p></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="ab002aef-58d3-3d1b-0cc0-104898c51dfa" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d237ae35ce47e3d6f27_anchor_17.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Web Action Cache</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Agents maintain your workflow as deterministic code, keeping automations always running</p></div></div><div class="home-stages-step_item"><div class="home-stages-step_item-thumbnail" data-w-id="668f0ddb-2d2a-9638-dd3e-7776cd650aff" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/68f90d23ba8596ac314b676b_anchor_19.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="home-stages-step_item-content"><div class="text-body-m text-weight-medium">Bring your own cloud</div><p class="text-body-m text-color-foreground_muted">Deploy Anchor in your cloud environment and using your own inference provider</p><div class="home-stages-step_item-partner"><div class="text-style-caption text-color-neutral_600">Available on</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d10ddcf261ccde7407a477_aws-marketplace-logo%201.png" loading="lazy" width="89" sizes="89px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d10ddcf261ccde7407a477_aws-marketplace-logo%201-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68e76a236cc487333075990b/69d10ddcf261ccde7407a477_aws-marketplace-logo%201.png 600w"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_h